{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"system","type":"text","text":"⚖️ **SYSTEM**\n**系统架构库**\n\n**内容:**\n- AI-OB Constitution\n- Cursor Rules\n- Architecture Blueprints\n- 数据结构 / Workflows\n\n**特点:**\n- 人类主导修改\n- Cursor 提案辅助","x":10,"y":-340,"width":300,"height":240,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"runtime","type":"text","text":"⚙️ **RUNTIME**\n**AI运行数据**\n\n**内容:**\n- notes/\n- cards/\n- audits/\n- drafts/ (AI草稿)\n- embeddings/\n\n**特点:**\n- AI可写入 notes/cards/audits/drafts\n- Drafts经Human审核可入 Cabinet","x":0,"y":155,"width":320,"height":410,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"cabinet","type":"text","text":"🌿 **CABINET**\n**用户知识库**\n\n**内容:**\n- daily, projects, knowledge, research, archive\n- AI生成草稿 Human审核后可入 Cabinet\n\n**特点:**\n- Human Only (AI默认只读)\n- 可单独在 Obsidian 打开","x":-680,"y":155,"width":300,"height":400,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"tools","type":"text","text":"🔧 **TOOLS**\n**工具与基础设施**\n\n**内容:**\n- Docker / Dify / n8n\n- 本地模型 3090\n- scripts / pipeline / CLI\n\n**特点:**\n- 独立运行\n- 不依赖 Cabinet 或 Runtime","x":580,"y":155,"width":300,"height":480,"color":"3"}
	],
